  "description": "Polaris ClickHouse v1: Kafka-engine ingestion lag and analytics insert health, proxied via the analytics-projector processor metrics. Also surfaces operator-escape-hatch usage. Most native ClickHouse internals (MV failed_state, query p99, parts count) are NOT exposed in v1 — see About panel for gaps and the path to a native exporter.",
