  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Polaris ClickHouse\n\n**v1 posture.** Polaris does **not** scrape ClickHouse natively in v1 (the `clickhouse` service in `docker-compose.yml` does not expose `/metrics`). The signals on this dashboard are derived from the **analytics-projector** processor, which is Polaris's ClickHouse inserter, plus the operator-escape-hatch counter from `packages/shared-clickhouse/src/raw.ts`.\n\n**Available metrics**:\n\n- `polaris_processor_lag_ms_last{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\"}` — proxy for Kafka-engine → analytics insert lag\n- `polaris_processor_events_consumed_total{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\"}` — proxy for the rate of rows landing in `analytics.events`\n- `polaris_processor_events_failed_total{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\", reason=...}` — proxy for materialized-view / insert failures (`reason` carries the failure class)\n- `polaris_processor_events_dlq_total{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\"}` — events the inserter sent to DLQ after retry exhaustion\n- `polaris_clickhouse_operator_raw_query_total{caller}` — every operator escape-hatch raw query (audit signal)\n\n**Known gaps** (P10-003):\n\n- **No native ClickHouse Prometheus exporter** is wired in v1. To get `ClickHouseAsyncMetrics_ReplicasMaxQueueSize`, `failed_state` counts on materialized views, `Query` rate, query latency histograms, parts count, and disk usage, add a `clickhouse-exporter` (or the ClickHouse built-in `system.metrics` exporter) and a scrape stanza in `infra/prometheus/prometheus.yml`. Until that lands, this dashboard uses the proxies above and the panels for query-rate-by-table and query p99 are placeholders.\n- **Projection table freshness** is owned by `event-daily-counts` and similar ClickHouse projections. There is no v1 metric for projection freshness; placeholder panel calls it out.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 30000 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 120000 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["max"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "max by (partition) (polaris_processor_lag_ms_last{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\", environment=\"$environment\"})",
          "legendFormat": "partition {{partition}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Kafka-engine → analytics insert lag (ms, proxy via analytics-projector)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
