        "content": "## Query rate by table / query p99 latency — gap (placeholder)\n\nNot available in v1 — ClickHouse is not scraped by Prometheus. When the native exporter lands (see About panel), the panels become:\n\n- `sum by (database, table) (rate(ClickHouseProfileEvents_Query[5m]))` — query rate by table\n- `histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(ClickHouseProfileEvents_QueryTimeMicroseconds[5m])))` — query p99 latency\n\n## Projection table freshness — gap (placeholder)\n\nProjections like `event-daily-counts` need a freshness metric (e.g. `max(updated_at) - now`). No emitter exists in v1.",
